@startuml
' ============================================
' ooad-phase:   物件設計
' chapter:      6-1
' realizes:     UC-03, FR-10
' source:       backend/src/services/videoProcessing.service.js, backend/src/routes/internal-video.routes.js, STT_Whisper/src/main.py, STT_Whisper/src/mongodb_uploader.py（程式碼）
' verified:     2026-09-19
' status:       draft
' implemented:  yes
' ai-assisted:  yes / OpenAI Codex / 依 checkpoint pipeline、Mongo upload 與 internal webhook 重繪
' ============================================
!include ../_style.puml

title Pipeline處理與狀態回報循序圖

hide footbox
autonumber

participant "VideoProcessingQueue／\nVideoBatchProcessingService" as Scheduler
participant "STT_Whisper main.py／batch_main.py" as Pipeline
participant "JobManager／ResumeCheckpoint" as Checkpoint
participant "MongoDBUploader" as Uploader
database "video_segments_text" as SegmentStore
participant "InternalVideoController" as InternalController
participant "VideoProcessingService" as ProcessingService
database "Video model" as VideoModel
participant "FaqCacheService" as FaqCache
participant "NotificationService" as NotificationService
participant "YouTubeUploadService" as YouTubeService

Scheduler -> Pipeline : 啟動單支 run 或 batch item
Pipeline -> InternalController : POST /api/v1/internal/videos/{id}/processing/start\nX-Processing-Secret
InternalController -> ProcessingService : startVideoProcessing(videoId)
ProcessingService -> VideoModel : queued -> processing\nattemptCount + 1
VideoModel --> ProcessingService : processing Video
ProcessingService --> Pipeline : 200（重複 start 可冪等）

Pipeline -> Checkpoint : 建立／載入 manifest 與 stage checkpoint
Pipeline -> Pipeline : scan／extract_audio／transcribe／normalize
Pipeline -> Pipeline : leaf chunk；選用 hierarchy／parent embedding
Pipeline -> Pipeline : text／audio embedding；export + artifact validation
Pipeline -> Uploader : upload_all(config)
Uploader -> SegmentStore : idempotent upsert searchable segments
Uploader --> Pipeline : upload summary

alt 全部必要階段成功
  Pipeline -> InternalController : POST .../processing/complete\n{ durationSec, externalVideoId }
  InternalController -> ProcessingService : completeVideoProcessing(videoId, metadata)
  ProcessingService -> VideoModel : processing -> completed
  ProcessingService -> YouTubeService : scheduleYouTubeAutoUpload(video)
  ProcessingService -> FaqCache : clearFaqsForVideoCourses(video)
  ProcessingService -> NotificationService : fanoutVideoCompletedNotifications(video)
  ProcessingService --> Pipeline : 200（complete 可安全重送副作用）
else 任一必要階段失敗
  Pipeline -> InternalController : POST .../processing/fail\n{ errorCode, errorMessage }
  InternalController -> ProcessingService : failVideoProcessing(videoId, error)
  ProcessingService -> VideoModel : queued／processing -> failed
  ProcessingService --> Pipeline : 200（保留首次終止失敗）
end

note over Pipeline,ProcessingService
  parent hierarchy 與 parent retrieval 受 feature flag／rollout gate 控制；
  圖中不把 gated 路徑宣稱為 production-ready。非法狀態轉換回 409。
end note

@enduml
